catflow 0.8
1. Read Text           post.md
2. <parallel meta>   text -> [text, text, text]
     1. Title                (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "SEO headline"

     2. Summarize            (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "meta description, 155
                                         chars max"

     3. Extract Structured   (input:1)   Ministral 3B; "tags, category"
     4. Table to Text                    format=csv
3. Template            "---\ntitle: {1}\ndescription: {2}\n{3}\n---"
4. Template    (3,1)   "{1}\n\n{2}"
5. Save Text           post-published.md
